3
00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:11.100
Act too slowly and static baseline power drains your battery.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.271
Act too frantically and switching drag explodes.

5
00:00:14.751 --> 00:00:18.022
Between those two traps sits an exact optimal tempo

6
00:00:18.022 --> 00:00:21.743
